  "headline": "Scopolamine is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; a prior discontinuation posting for Padagis US LLC was dated 2025-11-03",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows scopolamine is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A previous FDA posting for Padagis US LLC scopolamine transdermal system was marked \"To Be Discontinued\" with an initial posting date of 2025-11-03.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across Corvale sites provides 10.4 days at Corvale East, 14.8 days at Corvale General, and 17 days at Corvale Lakeside.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option per the decision rule is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals NY LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional alternate manufacturers include Baxter Healthcare Corporation and Ingenus Pharmaceuticals, LLC, also not on the shortage list.",
      "cites": ["D6", "D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "One registered plant for a scopolamine label is Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3008957483) in India, last inspected 2024-07-19 with a VAI classification.",
